  "content_html": "<section style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-align: justify; font-size: 16px; color: rgb(62, 62, 62); visibility: visible;\"><section style=\"text-align: center; visibility: visible;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/jNSvMVkX72L826RPff6TOIiabMvBmE36mfsrY4oZfPcLGhUVtGkiaHxh2MALUmmbmhUFwDhakaDGtKVvNyKMMoLg/640?wx_fmt=gif#imgIndex=0\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img __bg_gif\" data-ratio=\"0.24559777571825764\" data-type=\"gif\" data-w=\"1079\" type=\"block\" data-imgfileid=\"100000013\" data-original-style=\"null\" data-index=\"3\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/jNSvMVkX72L826RPff6TOIiabMvBmE36mfsrY4oZfPcLGhUVtGkiaHxh2MALUmmbmhUFwDhakaDGtKVvNyKMMoLg/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=0\" _width=\"677px\" style=\"height: auto !important; visibility: visible !important; width: 676.969px !important;\" data-order=\"0\" alt=\"图片\" data-report-img-idx=\"0\" data-fail=\"0\"></section><section style=\"text-align: center; justify-content: center; display: flex; flex-flow: row; margin: 55px 0px 10px; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><section style=\"display: inline-block; width: auto; vertical-align: top; align-self: flex-start; flex: 0 0 auto; min-width: 5%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; padding: 0px 10px 4px 5px; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><section style=\"justify-content: center; display: flex; flex-flow: row; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><section style=\"display: inline-block; width: auto; vertical-align: top; align-self: flex-start; flex: 0 0 auto; background-color: rgb(227, 207, 170); min-width: 5%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; padding: 1px 9px; border-radius: 5px; overflow: hidden; margin: 0px 8px 0px 0px; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><section style=\"text-align: justify; color: rgb(255, 255, 255); box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><b style=\"box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"visibility: visible;\">专题讲座</span></b></p></section></section><section style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; width: auto; align-self: center; flex: 0 0 auto; min-width: 5%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><section style=\"text-align: justify; color: rgb(58, 74, 126); letter-spacing: 1px; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"visibility: visible;\">走进沈阳师范大学</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align: center; justify-content: center; display: flex; flex-flow: row; margin: 15px 0px 0px; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><section style=\"display: inline-block; width: 95%; vertical-align: top; align-self: flex-start; flex: 0 0 auto; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); height: auto; padding: 15px; border-top: 2px solid rgb(227, 207, 170); border-bottom: 2px solid rgb(227, 207, 170); box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><section style=\"text-align: justify; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 3px; line-height: 2; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"visibility: visible;\">在商业竞争愈发激烈的当下，公司并购已成为企业快速扩张、资源整合与转型升级的重要手段。为了提升在校研究生对此法律领域的认知与理解，2025年4月18日上午，北京盈科（沈阳）律师事务所监事会监事、股权高级合伙人、博望餐饮法务咨询团队创始人</span><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"visibility: visible;\">马俊龙律师</span></strong><span leaf=\"\" style=\"visibility: visible;\">来到沈阳师范大学为研究生们带来了一堂主题为</span><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"visibility: visible;\">《公司并购交易法律实务》</span></strong><span leaf=\"\" style=\"visibility: visible;\">的精彩课程。</span></p></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align: center; margin: 40px 0px 20px; line-height: 0; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><section style=\"max-width: 100%; vertical-align: middle; display: inline-block; line-height: 0; width: 90%; height: auto; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/jNSvMVkX72LcdHNlQY24LibMC0ibibau4FUxQqpgBQxgdLpXLwOPq302zT1Bic4vqg48oEFvhIo3bk0jkgwEuknickA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg#imgIndex=1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.75\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; max-width: 100%; width: 609.297px !important; box-sizing: border-box; height: auto !important; visibility: visible !important;\" data-original-style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" data-index=\"4\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/jNSvMVkX72LcdHNlQY24LibMC0ibibau4FUxQqpgBQxgdLpXLwOPq302zT1Bic4vqg48oEFvhIo3bk0jkgwEuknickA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=1\" _width=\"100%\" alt=\"图片\" data-report-img-idx=\"1\" data-fail=\"0\"></section></section><section style=\"transform: perspective(0px);-webkit-transform: perspective(0px);-moz-transform: perspective(0px);-o-transform: perspective(0px);transform-style: flat;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"text-align: left;margin-top: 10px;margin-bottom: 10px;line-height: 0;transform: translate3d(-20px, 0px, 0px) rotateY(180deg);-webkit-transform: translate3d(-20px, 0px, 0px) rotateY(180deg);-moz-transform: translate3d(-20px, 0px, 0px) rotateY(180deg);-o-transform: translate3d(-20px, 0px, 0px) rotateY(180deg);box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;width: 20%;height: auto;box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/UnRw0ARGZUBWib8icatlF3bXYwTjGXBNVPpVtTR5icVIbDCpdydGlR1Dx6XOOmYzrIUfZTfGKdnrK8YeIEHafyicQA/640?wx_fmt=png#imgIndex=2\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img js_img_placeholder wx_img_placeholder\" data-ratio=\"0.17317073170731706\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-w=\"410\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; aspect-ratio: calc(5.77465) / 1; width: 135px !important; height: auto !important;\" data-original-style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" data-index=\"5\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3C%3Fxml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'%3F%3E%3Csvg width='1px' height='1px' viewBox='0 0 1 1' version='1.1' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' xmlns:xlink='http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink'%3E%3Ctitle%3E%3C/title%3E%3Cg stroke='none' stroke-width='1' fill='none' fill-rule='evenodd' fill-opacity='0'%3E%3Cg transform='translate(-249.000000, -126.000000)' fill='%23FFFFFF'%3E%3Crect x='249' y='126' width='1' height='1'%3E%3C/rect%3E%3C/g%3E%3C/g%3E%3C/svg%3E\" _width=\"100%\" alt=\"图片\"></section></section></section><section style=\"margin: 40px 0px 20px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 3px;line-height: 2;padding: 0px 20px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;马俊龙律师在公司设立、股权架构设计、股权激励与合伙制、投融资并购、商业特许经营、税务筹划、国企国资、新三板挂牌、企业上市辅导、债务重组、公司商事争议解决等具有多年丰富经验。</span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 课堂上，马律师主要从企业融资方案选择、并购交易结构设计、并购交易中的法律工作及并购案例分享等四方面主要展开讲解。他强调，并购并非简单的资产买卖，而是一场涉及战略规划、法律合规、财务评估等多维度的综合性交易。马律师结合多个经典案例，从前期的尽职调查，到交易结构的设计，选择合适的股权收购、资产收购方式；再到合同谈判与签订，如何在条款中防范法律风险，让研究生们认识到公司法律实务的丰富性与挑战性。</span></p></section></section><section style=\"text-align: center;margin-top: 10px;margin-bottom: 10px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;width: 90%;height: auto;box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/jNSvMVkX72LcdHNlQY24LibMC0ibibau4FU99dmxiaYIxUqqBTwrFLUoXRNt477uKsaej54oibSicjNf51eR019hic0ww/640?wx_fmt=jpeg#imgIndex=3\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img js_img_placeholder wx_img_placeholder\" data-ratio=\"0.7611111111111111\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; aspect-ratio: calc(1.31387) / 1; width: 609px !important; height: auto !important;\" data-original-style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" data-index=\"6\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3C%3Fxml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'%3F%3E%3Csvg width='1px' height='1px' viewBox='0 0 1 1' version='1.1' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' xmlns:xlink='http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink'%3E%3Ctitle%3E%3C/title%3E%3Cg stroke='none' stroke-width='1' fill='none' fill-rule='evenodd' fill-opacity='0'%3E%3Cg transform='translate(-249.000000, -126.000000)' fill='%23FFFFFF'%3E%3Crect x='249' y='126' width='1' height='1'%3E%3C/rect%3E%3C/g%3E%3C/g%3E%3C/svg%3E\" _width=\"100%\" alt=\"图片\"></section></section><section style=\"margin: 30px 0px 20px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 3px;line-height: 2;padding: 0px 20px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;同学们积极发言，提出自己面对课堂学习内心的疑惑。马律师耐心解答每一位同学的提问并结合自身经验进行点评与引导，让同学们在思维碰撞中深化了对问题的理解，丰富了法律知识储备。</span></p></section></section><section style=\"text-align: center;margin-top: 10px;margin-bottom: 10px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;width: 90%;height: auto;box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/jNSvMVkX72LcdHNlQY24LibMC0ibibau4FUVaNr66UHFmwnic6ia1NqsicJQ4EYRrC1Y7Jk8QDxdnxzFCneBu4gJTctA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg#imgIndex=4\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img js_img_placeholder wx_img_placeholder\" data-ratio=\"0.75\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; aspect-ratio: calc(1.33333) / 1; width: 609px !important; height: auto !important;\" data-original-style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" data-index=\"7\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3C%3Fxml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'%3F%3E%3Csvg width='1px' height='1px' viewBox='0 0 1 1' version='1.1' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' xmlns:xlink='http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink'%3E%3Ctitle%3E%3C/title%3E%3Cg stroke='none' stroke-width='1' fill='none' fill-rule='evenodd' fill-opacity='0'%3E%3Cg transform='translate(-249.000000, -126.000000)' fill='%23FFFFFF'%3E%3Crect x='249' y='126' width='1' height='1'%3E%3C/rect%3E%3C/g%3E%3C/g%3E%3C/svg%3E\" _width=\"100%\" alt=\"图片\"></section></section><section style=\"margin: 30px 0px 20px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 3px;line-height: 2;padding: 0px 20px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;本次讲座，为同学们打开了一扇通往专业领域的大门，提升他们在并购交易中应具备的专业素养与技能。盈科沈阳·博望餐饮法务咨询团队与师范大学的携手合作旨在为学生提供一个全方位、多层次的学习平台。未来，双方将继续深化合作，为学生提供更加丰富多样的学习机会。共同开创法律教育的新未来，为我国的法治建设贡献力量。</span></p></section></section><section style=\"transform: perspective(0px);-webkit-transform: perspective(0px);-moz-transform: perspective(0px);-o-transform: perspective(0px);transform-style: flat;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"text-align: left;margin-top: 10px;margin-bottom: 10px;line-height: 0;transform: translate3d(-20px, 0px, 0px) rotateY(180deg);-webkit-transform: translate3d(-20px, 0px, 0px) rotateY(180deg);-m